<title>UK: DG Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>DG Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up callable bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Genossenschaftsbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.50	MATURITY    02.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE  L 01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    =	   L- LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    FRFT	DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.125     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 02.OCT.97 AND THEN 5.5 PERCENT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		CALLABLE AT PAR ON 02.OCT.97.</p>
<p>		HYPOTHEKEN PFANDBRIEF REIHE 671.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
